WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.783
Create a run and name the release iteration.

2
00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:10.900
Describe the scope of this regression.

3
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.817
Set the build that will be tested.

4
00:00:14.817 --> 00:00:23.733
Assign an owner and select the checks.

5
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:27.133
Create the run with all 30 test cases.

6
00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:29.783
Start the run.

7
00:00:29.783 --> 00:00:35.100
Record the result of the first step.

8
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:39.717
Continue through the expected results.

9
00:00:39.717 --> 00:00:43.733
Pass the case and move to the next check.
